config/settings.yaml.bak_pre_B1_htfboost_20260720:1966:    buy_yes_15m_pocket_rsi_max: 65.0  # 2026-07-17 operator GO (65 of 60/65/70): THE REAL bnb 15m|up lever. Lane had 0 FILLS IN 65H. Cross-tab reason x htf_bias proved the blocked population is buy_yes_15m_pocket_off n=2137 and 100% BULLISH htf (BEARISH pocket_off = 0), RSI p10=56.5 p50=61.6 p90=71.3 — so the RSI arm is the ONLY binding gate and 35 was unreachable. My earlier include_bearish=true was a NO-OP (bearish arm has nothing to admit) and was reverted. 65 admits 1350/2137 = 63% of the blocked tape (60=38%, 70=86%). SINGLE LEVER: min_edge 0.09 untouched — it's the separate blocker for the 339 BEARISH longs (RSI 35.8-43.2) which already pass the pocket; if the newly-admitted bullish longs now die at lane_min_edge, THAT is the next lever (do not stack). Gate was 06-16 ghost-era; ghost severed 07-13 and BARRED. Break: revert 35.0 if >=10 closed AND (net<=-$8 OR WR<35%).
config/settings.yaml.bak_pre_B1_htfboost_20260720:1967:    buy_yes_15m_pocket_include_bearish: false  # 2026-07-17 REVERTED my own no-op 30min after deploying it. I proposed (and Codex endorsed) include_bearish=true to unlock bnb 15m|up's 0-fills-in-65h. PROVEN DEAD by reason x htf_bias cross-tab: the buy_yes_15m_pocket_off population is 2137 rows and 100% BULLISH htf (BEARISH pocket_off = 0). The bearish arm only admits BEARISH-htf longs => true unlocks EXACTLY 0 candidates. The 339 BEARISH longs never reach the pocket at all - they die earlier on lane_min_edge (RSI 35.8-43.2). Codex was mis-framed by me: I gave it 'RSI 55-70 + bearish arm off' and omitted that the blocked rows are all BULLISH. REAL lever = buy_yes_15m_pocket_rsi_max (35->60 admits 38%, 65->63%, 70->86% of the 2137) - pending operator GO. Reverted to keep config honest: true is dead today but would latently admit bearish longs if min_edge ever passes.
config/settings.yaml.bak_pre_B1_htfboost_20260720:1968:    buy_no_1h_pocket_rsi_min: 35.0  # 2026-07-17 operator+Codex GO: STRUCTURAL CONTRADICTION fix. bnb 1h = 1288/1335 candidates SHORT, htf 100% BEARISH, but 1280 died on buy_no_1h_pocket_off: gate needed RSI>=45 while bearish tape holds RSI p50=35.1 max=45.0 -> floor NEVER reachable => 2 fills/65h. Gate was anti-correlated with its own lane thesis and was built 06-16 on ghost-era EV buckets (ghost severed 07-13, barred). 35 = p50 of the blocked tape (~50% admit); Codex chose 35 over 30/removal since lane has only n=2 live data. Break: revert 45.0 if net<=-$8 over 10 closes OR WR<35%.
config/settings.yaml.bak_pre_B1_htfboost_20260720:1973:    disable_buy_yes: false  # 2026-07-15 BNB-LONGS-REVIVE operator GO: re-enable longs - dig 436 fills: high-RSI -$100/32%, LOW-RSI +$43/48% = the lane wasnt all bad, the 07-12 -$47 disable buried a profitable oversold half. Isolated via overbought hard-gate (rsi_buy_block_above 53 + hard) + 0.70 stop on naked 5m up + existing 0.3x size. Break: 10 closed, re-disable if net<=-$20 or WR<38%
