config/settings.yaml:467:    hold_mfe_conditional_stop_enabled: true   # 2026-08-10 STAGED (Codex round-2 GO) — never-green (peak MFE<8%) cut shallow -34%, ever-green rides. Codex round-1 NO-GO (bypasses [1h] window axis on fast windows) was REFUTED by the ghost split: held (updown_expired) counterfactual shows never-green 5m/15m that dip past -34% recover 0/14 (100% resolve to a loss), while ever-green 5m/15m ride at 90% WR. Cutting the 14 dead losers: -$188 -> -$62 (+$126, zero winners forfeited). This is the "$16 never-green loss -> $5 cut" fix. STAGED not restarted (frozen at live_testing.__init__ — takes effect on next restart). _is_fav>=0.82 exemption is a cleanup note (favorite generators return [] when favorite_lane_enabled:false).
