   293	        # noise and lock a gap-through loss (hold beats stop on sol/xrp/hype 5m+15m; doge 1h is the
   294	        # LONE lane where holding LOSES ~-35). Gate the early cuts to the windows where holding
   295	        # actually loses -> default {"1h"}. On 5m/15m the position rides to resolution; the
