codex
A key nuance: the proposed “restore” is not a pure diff from the +869 backup. The current config already matches several clean-TP lane values (`bitcoin 15m down`, `xrp 1h up/down`, `xrp 5m down`), while some proposed engine lanes were hold lanes in +869 (`xrp 5m up`, `hype 5m up`, `bitcoin 1h up`) and would not be a wholesale restore.
