codex
The normalized/code pass found a bigger issue than the proposal states: in `updown_exit_shared.py`, `hold_all` is applied after per-lane overrides and is documented as “FINAL word.” That means setting lane-level `hold=false` in YAML will not restore regular TP while `hold_all: true` remains active.
