  1297	                    # winner that peaked then REVERSED is banked instead of round-tripping to catastrophic.
  1298	                    # Arms only once the position was clearly green (peak MFE >= arm), then triggers on a
  1299	                    # real retrace from the peak (>= retrace). A still-climbing runner never retraces, so
  1300	                    # it is NOT cut (the failure mode of the old fixed-level trails). arm 0.30 + retrace
  1301	                    # 0.20 => banks at >= +10% (still green). NOT gated by the executable-net guard (a
  1302	                    # retracing winner should exit even into a thinning book — realistic_paper_fills models
